FineLAP model and research: xiquan-li and FineLAP contributors.
Source: https://github.com/xiquan-li/FineLAP
Checkpoint: https://huggingface.co/AndreasXi/FineLAP

This repository adapts the inference-required Python files from the author's
Hugging Face model repository `AndreasXi/FineLAP` at revision
`b419aa22947d29907a5567f21b81bf3b39a40449`. That repository's model card
declares MIT. The files are under `src/finelap_infer/_impl/`; see
`docs/source-provenance.md` for exact source hashes and changes. Training,
evaluation, dataset and plotting code are not included. The package's
original wrapper code is by openmirlab contributors.

No model weights are bundled. The author GitHub source repository still has no
explicit LICENSE as of 2026-11-13; the Hugging Face model card's MIT metadata
is the recorded permission basis for these specific Hugging Face files. Seek
author confirmation before mirroring other upstream code or publishing to PyPI.
The MIT source license does not grant rights to unrelated third-party assets.
